OL,3,GNEWSASchool exam boss to step down
OL,4,Aafter two years in post
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief executive of Scotland's new
OL,7,Fschool exam body has announced he will
OL,8,Fstand down next year.
OL,10,FNick Page oversaw the transition of the
OL,11,FScottish Qualifications Authority (SQA)
OL,12,Fto Qualifications Scotland (QS) in
OL,13,FDecember 2025.
OL,15,FPage, who will depart his role after
OL,16,Fresults day in August 2027, said he was
OL,17,Fleaving the organisation in a "strong
OL,18,Fplace".
OL,20,FQS said the recruitment process for his
OL,21,Freplacement would start in the new
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
